cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Pacioli in academic work, please cite the project itself
  rather than individual contributors. This CITATION.cff follows the
  CFF standard (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
title: Pacioli
abstract: >-
  A read-only compliance scanner for any Checkov-supported IaC
  framework (Terraform, CloudFormation, Kubernetes, Helm, Bicep, ARM,
  Dockerfile, OpenAPI, …). Built on Checkov, but aggregates
  per-environment SARIF into a single coverage matrix mapped to a
  chosen framework (PCI DSS v4.0.1 by default; SOC 2, CIS, NIST
  800-53, ISO 27001, and any custom framework via mapping packs).
  Emits a self-contained HTML report with full per-requirement
  drill-down, in-line remediation HCL for Terraform-family packs
  (the shipped PCI/Azure pack ships azurerm 4.x fixes), severity
  breakdowns, and a CI gate.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
